---
import Layout from "../../Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Support - Practice">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-xl space-y-6 px-4 pb-12">
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <h1 class="font-semibold text-2xl">Practice Support</h1>
      <p class="opacity-60">
        Help with Practice: Habit Tracker on iPhone, Android and the web.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-xl">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions, bugs or ideas? Email <a
          href="mailto:hello@praveenjuge.com?subject=Practice%20support"
          class="underline decoration-2 underline-offset-1"
        >
          hello@praveenjuge.com
        </a> and I'll get back to you. Including your device and app version helps.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-xl">Signing in</h2>
      <p>
        Practice uses Sign in with Apple or Google. Use the same account on
        every device to see the same habits.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-xl">Syncing across devices</h2>
      <p>
        Your habits and check-ins are saved to your account, so they show up on
        your iPhone, your Android phone and at
        <a
          href="https://practice.praveenjuge.com"
          class="underline decoration-2 underline-offset-1"
        >
          practice.praveenjuge.com
        </a>. If something looks out of date, close and reopen the app.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-xl">Deleting your account</h2>
      <p>
        In the app, tap the account icon on the home screen and choose Delete
        Account. On the web, use Delete account at the top of the page. This
        permanently deletes your account, habits and check-ins.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-xl">Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Read how your data is handled in the <a
          href="/practice/privacy/"
          class="underline decoration-2 underline-offset-1"
        >
          privacy policy
        </a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
